Has anyone had success getting an X server ported for this card. The
Raptor GFX is basically a Number Nine Imagine 128 Series 2 with
OpenBootProm-aware firmware. It is an 8MB card, and Tech-Source is the
manufacturer. They sell it with a multi-headed X server.

This is a very cool card, except for the fact it has no UltraPenguin
driver.

We are willing to give a card to someone who can successfully port the
I128 Linux driver.

Respond to me directly if you are interested in doing this.

